    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) on 1 **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit of yours in range of an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** that you control. The marker becomes mutated and stays under your control until a phase ends with your opponent holding a higher **Level of Control** over it than you.\n\nWhile the marker is mutated and you control it, whenever an enemy unit finishes a **Normal move**, an **[Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**, a **[Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** or a **Charge move** in range of it, roll a D6. On a 4+, it suffers D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.",
